=== Day3 ===
Hi love! How are you?
I tried calling you, but I know right now you're probably not home.
Anyway, I'm leaving you this message.
I miss you!
It's getting cold here.

She's glad I'm here but i'm feeling homesick whenever i have to cook.
Uff, I promised myself these phonecalls had to be happier, but whenever I think of you, i can't help but becoming nostalgic.
Shouldn't be long luckily!
And I believe may be able to come back sooner.
But I wouldn't take my word for it.
Sometimes I wonder if i got in the wrong area of work.

I have to go, now.
